<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lucent started outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lucent started outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of Lucent Technologies Inc with an outperform rating.  </p>
<p>-- Added company to recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Called Lucent &quot;a core company within our universe of telecommunications equipment coverage.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Set initial 12-month price target of $70 per share based on multiple of about 25 times calendar 1998 earnings estimate of $2.80.  </p>
<p>-- Shares rose 5/8 to 60-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
